    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel permanent though. it feels like the world just moved on without me. i see them all laughing and talking in groups and i know if i tried to walk up to any of them, it would just be awkward or they'd look at me with that pitying face. like i'm a mistake they're all trying to forget. it's just exhausting to keep trying to exist in a world where you don't belong anymore.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
