      "content": "The feeling that the world has moved on without you is a heavy weight, but it's a feeling, not a fact. It's exhausting to constantly perform the act of \"existing\" when you feel so disconnected. Instead of forcing yourself into those groups, perhaps you could explore one small, solitary activity that brings you even a tiny bit of peace. Remember that even small moments of quiet self-care matter.",
      "source": "target",
