      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's completely understandable to feel that life is broken when you're in this much pain; that emptiness is a real and heavy thing. The idea of fixing everything is too big, so maybe you don't need to \"fix\" your life, but just find a way to make the *next* moment a tiny bit easier. Sometimes the only way out of the loop is to simply give yourself permission to stop fighting so hard to be \"normal.\"",
